morning), which was **degraded** with an 18% error rate and unhealthy in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west).\n- Rolled back to **v5.0.0**, the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- Verified post-rollback: `payments-api` is now **healthy** (error rate 0.2%) on v5.0.0 in all regions.\n\n**Incident:**\n- Opened **SEV2** incident **INC-0001** (\"Payments API errors after v5.1.0 deploy\"), which paged the on-call engineer. Summary documents the v5.1.0 deploy as the cause and the rollback to v5.0.0 as the remediation.\n\nNote: the rollback to v5.0.0 was a previously healthy production version, so no change-manager approval was required.", "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": []}]}